  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of Agriculture livelihoods  employment through  investment in land reclamation  water reservoirs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(a) Strengthen the capacity of the Green Plan to implement rural development projects for vulnerable people.
(b) Improve the livelihood of small and medium farmer communities through 390 ha of land reclamation and water conservation.
(c) Improve the know-how of 1220 farmers in establishing and managing orchards and irrigation systems.
(d) create over 80 000 man/day  job opportunities in the agriculture sector.</narrative>
  </description>
